@page "/Home"

<PageTitle>WellBore</PageTitle>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h3" Class="mt-4 mb-3">WellBore</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
    Manage WellBores, their identity values, feature assignments, trajectories, survey runs, and portable backups.
</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Class="mb-2">WellBore management</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
    Open <MudLink Href="/WellBore/webapp/WellBore">WellBore</MudLink> to browse and edit records.
    Use <MudLink Href="/WellBore/webapp/WellBoreFeatures">WellBore Features</MudLink> and
    <MudLink Href="/WellBore/webapp/WellBoreIdentities">WellBore Identities</MudLink> to manage the shared catalogues.
</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Class="mb-2">Backup and restore</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
    The <MudLink Href="/WellBore/webapp/WellBoreBackupRestore">Backup and Restore</MudLink> page exports all or selected
    WellBores with their referenced catalogue definitions and restores validated documents atomically.
</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Class="mb-2">Survey display and contextual data</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body1">
    Survey displays provide trajectory and survey-run views. Contextual pages provide access to related Well, Cluster,
    and Field information.
</MudText>
